      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is the minimum order for recycled clothing?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">300 pieces per style minimum. This applies per design, colorway, and size range. Lower quantities possible at higher per-piece cost for sampling or prototype runs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Are you GRS certified for recycled materials?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We are GRS (Global Recycled Standard) certified for recycled material production. Our certification covers recycled polyester, recycled cotton, and other recycled fibers. Transaction certificates provided for each batch.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What recycled material options do you offer?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We offer rPET (recycled polyester from PET bottles), recycled cotton from pre-consumer waste, recycled cotton from post-consumer waste, recycled nylon, and recycled wool blends. All materials are GRS certified.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What recycled products do you manufacture?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We manufacture recycled polyester activewear, recycled cotton t-shirts and basics, recycled cotton hoodies and sweatshirts, recycled denim, and recycled performance fabrics for outdoor apparel.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How does recycled material compare to virgin?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Recycled materials offer comparable strength and performance to virgin materials. rPET has similar strength and durability to virgin polyester. Recycled cotton maintains similar softness and comfort. Color consistency and wash durability are comparable to virgin materials.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does recycled clothing production take?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Standard production timeline: 30-40 days from fabric receipt for basic recycled clothing. 35-50 days for custom fabric development or specialized recycled materials. 7-14 days for sampling before bulk.</p>
